    <briefdescription>
<para>Writes the CORS response headers onto every outgoing response. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>CORS response headers, written in exactly one place (the pre-sending advice in <ref refid="server_8cpp" kindref="compound">server.cpp</ref>). Drogon stores headers in a map keyed by the lower-cased name, and addHeader replaces an existing value (HttpResponseImpl.h:194-210), so a header can never appear twice. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
